    \cdot \operatornamewithlimits{\mathbb{E}}\nolimits_{t}\insquare{z_i^2 \mid z\in P_j}
    \leq \max_j \operatornamewithlimits{\mathbb{E}}\nolimits_{t}\insquare{z_i^2 \mid z\in P_j}\,,\\
    \operatornamewithlimits{\mathbb{E}}\nolimits_{t}\insquare{z_i^4 \mid z\in P}
    &= 
