            3 \inparen{1 + \abs{y_{\max}} + \abs{\mu_i(t)}}^4\,.
    \end{align*}
    Substituting $\mu_i(t)=\inangle{W_t^\top x}_i\leq \relax{W_t^\top x}_\infty$ implies that 
